    "body": "Windows and macOS require precomputing a \"timebase\" in order to convert OS timestamps into nanoseconds. Retrieve and compute this value during runtime initialization to avoid data races when accessing the time.\r\n\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-130421 -->\n* Issue: gh-130421\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n",
