      "merge_method": "squash",
      "commit_title": "gh-130421: Fix data race on timebase initialization (gh-130592)",
      "commit_message": "Windows and macOS require precomputing a \"timebase\" in order to convert\nOS timestamps into nanoseconds. Retrieve and compute this value during\nruntime initialization to avoid data races when accessing the time.\n"
    },
